le=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/9_x_7.\" title=\"9 x 7.\">9 x 7.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cows_are_made_of_milk.\" title=\"Cows are made of milk.\">Cows are made of milk.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Thompson.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hey_mate.\" title=\"Hey mate.\">Hey mate.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bats,_bats,_hang_up.\" title=\"Bats, bats, hang up.\">Bats, bats, hang up.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Is_that_number_got_curves%3F\" title=\"Is that number got curves?\">Is that number got curves?</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drier_than_you_think,_chalk.\" title=\"Drier than you think, chalk.\">Drier than you think, chalk.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Am_I_an_idiom%3F\" title=\"Am I an idiom?\">Am I an idiom?</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_1970s_camping_kettle.\" title=\"A 1970s camping kettle.\">A 1970s camping kettle.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Supping_from_the_fountain.\" title=\"Supping from the fountain.\">Supping from the fountain.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Thompson.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a6/Thompson..png/revision/latest?cb=20250925224221\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Thompson.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a6/Thompson..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250925224221\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a6/Thompson..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250925224221 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a6/Thompson..png/revision/latest?cb=20250925224221 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Thompson.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Thompson..png\" data-image-name=\"Thompson..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">20</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\">Maisie Adam</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cows_are_made_of_milk.\" title=\"Cows are made of milk.\">Cows are made of milk.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hey_mate.\" title=\"Hey mate.\">Hey mate.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Thompson.</b></i> is the third episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">Series 20</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 25 September 2025. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\">Maisie Adam</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Thompson.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Thompson\" was the name written on the twins' shirts in the <a href=\"/wiki/Discover_the_name_of_the_person_in_the_lab\" title=\"Discover the name of the person in the lab\">Discover the name of the person in the lab</a> task. The title card shows the board and a snake as a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Win_Snakes_and_Steps\" title=\"Win Snakes and Steps\">Win Snakes and Steps</a> task, while the two chess pieces appearing on the board reference the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_most_accurate_little_model_of_the_Chesham_United_mascot\" title=\"Make the most accurate little model of the Chesham United mascot\">Make the most accurate little model of the Chesham United mascot</a> task. The board is reflected in a mirror, which might potentially reference the twins in the <a href=\"/wiki/Discover_the_name_of_the_person_in_the_lab\" title=\"Discover the name of the person in the lab\">Discover the name of the person in the lab</a> task.  The text reading the episode's title is spaced out so the letters perfectly fit the tiles, and is also present in the reflection.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Thompson.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 0 5px 5px 5px;\">&#8220;\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.5;\"><i>The contestants have a tricky time identifying someone in the lab, leading <a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a> to ponder a 1980s pop group and <a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\">Maisie Adam</a> to rely on the lyrics to a 1990s dance tune. <a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a> is unsure of the difference between snakes and worms, <a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</a> creates a disturbing tableau, and <a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\">Reece Shearsmith</a> gets quite angry with a large yellow cube. <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> issues the points and <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> very often agrees with his decisions.</i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px -3px 5px;\">&#8221;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\">- British Comedy Guide\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.comedy.co.uk/tv/taskmaster/episodes/20/3/\">[1]</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ania Magliano</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Maisie Adam</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Phil Ellis</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Reece Shearsmith</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_thing_you_were_least_likely_to_bring_in_from_your_home\" title=\"The thing you were least likely to bring in from your home\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The thing you were least likely to bring in from your home.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_most_accurate_little_model_of_the_Chesham_United_mascot\" title=\"Make the most accurate little model of the Chesham United mascot\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the most accurate little model of the Chesham United mascot. You may only see what is inside two of the toilet tents. Go Generals.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Discover_the_name_of_the_person_in_the_lab\" title=\"Discover the name of the person in the lab\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Discover the name of the person in the lab. You must take it in turns to ask one question and the person may only say yes or no. The other team members must remain in this room until the questioner returns. Each person in your team must address the person in the lab by the correct name before the task is complete.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Win_Snakes_and_Steps\" title=\"Win Snakes and Steps\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Create your own Snakes and Steps board. You must add one snake and one set of steps. You must also add one mystery box. The instruction inside the mystery box is up to you.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Win Snakes and Steps. Players will move from youngest to oldest. You must throw the dice properly each time and you must not tamper with the die. If you land on the head of a snake, you must slither down to its tail. If you land at the base of a step, you must climb it. If you land on the mystery box, you must do what it says.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Turn_your_cup_triangle_completely_upside_down\" title=\"Turn your cup triangle completely upside down\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Turn your cup triangle completely upside down. Your upside-down cup triangle must be free-standing and you must obey the instructions written on each layer. If any cups fall, you must completely start again. You may not affect other people's cup triangles.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">19\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>11\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Thompson.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is the first episode since <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Toshwash.\" title=\"Toshwash.\">Toshwash.</a></span> to not be named after a quote from either of the hosts or contestants, although the name is eventually said by many contestants throughout the task.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Thompson.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster\"><i>Thompson.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920140502\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.127 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1043/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26935/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 721/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800474/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   68.153      1 -total\n 46.62%   31.774      1 Template:Spoilers\n 44.75%   30.496      1 Template:MessageBox\n 23.79%   16.213      1 Template:Episode_infobox\n 22.64%   15.433      1 Template:Episodes\n 14.10%    9.612     11 Template:Link\n  3.48%    2.374      1 Template:Chronology\n  3.23%    2.201      5 Template:Color\n  2.31%    1.574      1 Template:Quote\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_task:pcache:idhash:5645-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260920140502 and revision id 44374. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}}}